      <activity id="f3300894-84af-5801-b282-14b0bccba047" activityNameId="55a7f2ca-916c-590a-af58-35bec6d9a182" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sewer system, reinforced concrete pipe, DN 600, profile 2</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sewer system, reinforced concrete pipe, DN 600, profile 2
Modern Swiss und European technologies are applied to building machines, material production and building processes. 
UUID: 528f4905-ad7b-499d-9bfc-8bbae0303b4b
This process models 1 meter of sewer system infrastructure with reinforced concrete pipe, DN 600, profile 2 according to SIA 190. Trench depth: 3 meters. This process includes the production phase (A1–A3), the construction phase/ transport (A4–A5) as well as deconstruction phase (C1), transport phase (C2), treatment/ recycling phase (C3), and final disposal phase (C4) for one meter of sewer system with reinforced concrete pipe.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Complete sewer system, DN 600, profile 2 according to SIA 190.Trench depth 3 meters Reinforced concrete pipe, 600 mm, outer diameter 780 mm, wall thickness 90 mm, 540 kg/m, 2770 kg/m³. A1-A5 and C1-C4
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_528f4905-ad7b-499d-9bfc-8bbae0303b4b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
